## Review history and convergence

Plan Pass 1 found the `EVIDENCE_INTAKE` parent-launch concern and a missing
reservation chain. The first finding was withdrawn after checking that the runtime
permits non-parent intake; the second was fixed with an explicit reservation chain.
Plan Pass 2 raised mutable `pins.head`; that concern was withdrawn because checkpoint
155's pin `83d3…` is stale while actual `HEAD` is `1c81…`, and publication `INTENT`
alone binds the current base. Plan Pass 3 found unbound integration; the repair added
exact manifest/operation binding. Plan Pass 4 confirmed the resulting plan, SHA-256
`8a253115cec3800fd59e0af65ecdbe23569778ab98f2a4219139e2964834c443`.

Artifact Pass 1 found no substantive defect, but the full mirror lifecycle was then
unfinished. Artifact Pass 2 rechecked the E2 range and completed the evidence below.
It found the following HIGH finding:

| Pass | Severity | Finding — English term + русское объяснение | Status |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Artifact 2 | HIGH | **Control revision gate missing** — `_resume_completed_source_recovery` can bypass the startup-fatal guard before `resume_checkpoint` validates `control.version == 11` and `team_runtime_version == 1`; то есть старый control мог допустить recovery. | Fixed in E3: a three-line fail-closed helper guard checks both exact values before the bypass; two negative cases cover control 10 and runtime 0. |
| Artifact 3 | None | **Revision guard validation** — точный E3 diff и целевые negative cases подтверждают, что bypass отвергает control 10 и runtime 0. | No finding. |
| Artifact 4 | None | **Independent unchanged-tip confirmation** — независимый запуск real-startup regression на чистом E3 прошёл. | No finding. |

Artifact Pass 3 verified E3's exact 8-line delta from E2, clean diff, the two negative
cases, and the supplied targeted regression log. Artifact Pass 4 independently ran
the same real-startup regression on unchanged clean E3:

`python3 -m unittest orchestrator.tests.test_workflow_runtime.TeamRuntimeTests.test_completed_source_confirmation_uses_real_startup_and_exact_provenance`

It passed: 1 test in 5.598 s, `OK`. The existing isolated mirror uses control 11 and
Team Runtime 1, so E3's restriction preserves that positive lifecycle evidence.
There are no unresolved substantive findings in Passes 3–4; Mode A has converged for
this recovery fix only. This is not approval of a broader publication or mathematical
result.

