## Boundary and verdict

This is a separate checkpoint-recovery repair. It does not close original issue
`d9` or approve candidate `777`; it only verifies the recovery-fix series relative
to the `7772494a` baseline. It performs no deployment, canonical integration, or
production push. It makes no mathematical acceptance claim; `PX_RH_CLAIM` remains
`NOT_MADE`.
